/ ICINT V13 MAPSTORE DIAGNOSTIC WORKLOAD
/
/ PURPOSE:
/   BUILD A FOUR-FRAME BCPL CALL CHAIN, LEAVE RECOGNIZABLE VALUES IN
/   LOCALS AND GLOBALS, THEN EXECUTE X38. ICINT IMPLEMENTS ONLY X1-X37,
/   SO X38 MUST TAKE THE NORMAL INTCODE ERROR PATH AND RETURN -1.
/
/ EXPECTED DERIVED VALUES:
/   G!200 = 123
/   G!201 = 246
/   G!202 = 256
/   G!203 = 253
/
/ CALL CHAIN AT FAILURE:
/   START -> LEVEL1 -> LEVEL2 -> CRASH
/
/ EACH K8 CALL CREATES A FRAME WITH:
/   P!0 = PREVIOUS P
/   P!1 = RETURN C
/   P!2 = LOCAL RESULT
/
/ THIS IS A DIAGNOSTIC TEST, NOT HISTORICAL INTCODE SOURCE.

/ START: 100 + 23 = 123
1 L100 L23 X8 SP2 SG200
  LL2 K8
  X22

/ LEVEL1: G!200 * 2 = 246
2 LIG200 L2 X5 SP2 SG201
  LL3 K8
  X4

/ LEVEL2: G!201 + 10 = 256
3 LIG201 L10 X8 SP2 SG202
  LL4 K8
  X4

/ CRASH: G!202 - 3 = 253, THEN INTENTIONALLY INVALID X-OP
4 LIG202 L3 X9 SP2 SG203
  X38
  X4

/ ICINT INITIAL CODE CALLS GLOBAL 1.
G1L1
Z
